        "public": {
          "prompt": "Complete selected_release and procedure without modifying releases or current_database_schema. Select the prior release identified by supplied compatibility evidence, not the current or incompatible release. In procedure, build.action must be \"create executable artifact\"; release.action must be \"bind artifact and intended configuration in immutable release\", with release_id, artifact and configuration from the selected record; run.action must be \"start selected release processes\" with its release_id. Record database_schema_after_rollback as the unchanged current schema. These are records, not deployment commands. Use exactly this structure, with no additional keys: procedure = {'build': {'action': 'create executable artifact'}, 'release': {'action': 'bind artifact and intended configuration in immutable release', 'release_id': selected_release['release_id'], 'artifact': selected_release['artifact'], 'configuration': selected_release['configuration']}, 'run': {'action': 'start selected release processes', 'release_id': selected_release['release_id']}, 'database_schema_after_rollback': current_database_schema}. selected_release must contain the complete selected release record.",
